   176	`T_i` with zero valuation on `R_i`: the unique defining function has valuation
   177	two there, and zero valuation would contradict the already-proved boundary
   178	class injection.  Function-pair work is a useful coordinate tactic, not
   179	independent first-leg data; Miyanishi manufactures the first leg from
   180	`(U,rho)`.
   181	
