+**CONFIRMED — (1.11).** At the interior companion, etaleness makes `p=f-f(u_c), q=g-g(u_c)` a regular parameter pair, so the completion is `C[[p,q]]`. The bracket gives exactly `X_f=kappa partial_q` and `X_g=-kappa partial_p`.
