+**CONFIRMED — (1.9).** The `u^0` coefficient of `{f,g}` is exactly `2(f_1g_0'-f_0'g_1)=kappa`; consequently `f_0'` and `g_0'` have no common zero (indeed they generate the unit ideal in `C[Z]`).
