+**CONFIRMED — (1.1), with a notation qualification.** Completing `C[A,U,Z]` along `(A,U)` gives `C[Z][[A,U]]`. Since `q_A=-1-2AZ` is a unit, the formal implicit-function theorem eliminates `A` uniquely. Direct substitution gives
